sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as trainer-controller-manager
    participant OSAPI as OpenShift APIServer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant JobSetCtrl as JobSet Controller
    participant Pods as Training Pods<br/>29500/TCP TCP

    Note over User,Pods: Flow 1: TrainJob Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrainJob<br/>(references TrainingRuntime)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>HTTPS :9443 TLS (API server cert)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TrainJob created<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET TrainingRuntime/ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Runtime spec

    Controller->>OSAPI: GET config.openshift.io/v1/apiservers<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    OSAPI-->>Controller: TLS security profile

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Apply JobSet resource<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup (CoScheduling/Volcano)<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create MPI SSH Secret + Hostfile ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Apply NetworkPolicy (RHOAI)<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token

    K8sAPI-->>JobSetCtrl: Watch: JobSet created
    JobSetCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Training Pods
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch: Pod status updates

    Note over Controller,Pods: Flow 2: RHOAI Progression Tracking

    Controller->>K8sAPI: List pods for TrainJob<br/>HTTPS :443 SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Pod list with IPs

    loop Poll interval (5s-300s)
        Controller->>Pods: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP :28080 (NetworkPolicy restricted)
        Pods-->>Controller: Training metrics JSON
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch TrainJob annotation<br/>(progress update) HTTPS :443
    end

    Note over Pods,Pods: Flow 3: PyTorch Distributed Training

    Pods->>Pods: torchrun rendezvous<br/>TCP :29500 via headless service
    Note right of Pods: All ranks connect to rank-0<br/>No encryption (NetworkPolicy: same-job pods)
    Pods->>Pods: NCCL/Gloo collective ops<br/>Inter-pod communication
